cleargets
stop INTWAKE
q INTEGRVS
fbank 13
get RN:dp
get RN+2:dp
get RN+4:dp
get VN:dp
get VN+2:dp
get VN+4:dp
get PIPTIME:dp
get PBODY
get ORIGEX
get X2
